{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 13 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">配准与投影几何：可微变换、拓扑约束和 SE(3) 闭环</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Registration &amp; SE(3)</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_068_gradicon-title\">GradICON</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">通过双向预测与复合映射 Jacobian 的 gradient inverse-consistency 正则获得近似微分同胚。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Enforces diffeomorphic regularity without tuning sensitive multi-scale smoothness weights by penalizing the Frobenius norm of the composed forward–backward Jacobian deviation from identity.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图像 A 与图像 B</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Ordered pairs (I^A, I^B) and (I^B, I^A) fed symmetrically to a registration network</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">近似互逆、规则的双向配准映射 Phi_AB 与 Phi_BA</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Approximately diffeomorphic, inverse-consistent forward map Φ^AB and backward map Φ^BA</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2023/html/Tian_GradICON_Approximate_Diffeomorphisms_via_Gradient_Inverse_Consistency_CVPR_2023_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_068_gradicon')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_068_gradicon')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"GradICON original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/07598dd1edabdd73aa9a.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_068_gradicon', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_068_gradicon\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_068_gradicon')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_068_gradicon', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_068_gradicon\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图像 A/B</span><span class=\"lang-en\">A/B</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">交换顺序后分别预测两个方向</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests ordered pairs (i^a, i^b) and (i^b, i^a) fed symmetrically to a registration network and prepares initial tensor representations (A/B).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"交换顺序后分别预测两个方向\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests ordered pairs (i^a, i^b) and (i^b, i^a) fed symmetrically to a registration network and prepares initial tensor representations (A/B).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"图像 A/B\" data-node-name-en=\"A/B\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_068_gradicon', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图像 A/B</span><span class=\"lang-en\">A/B</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">交换顺序后分别预测两个方向</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests ordered pairs (i^a, i^b) and (i^b, i^a) fed symmetrically to a registration network and prepares initial tensor representations (A/B).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多尺度卷积网络 g_theta 对两个方向复用权重\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes registration to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"共享配准网络\" data-node-name-en=\"registration\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_068_gradicon', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">共享配准网络</span><span class=\"lang-en\">registration</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多尺度卷积网络 g_theta 对两个方向复用权重</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes registration to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将 A 的坐标映射到 B 的预测变换\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Phi_AB within the core bidirectional gradient inverse consistent registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Phi_AB\" data-node-name-en=\"Phi_AB\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_068_gradicon', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Phi_AB</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将 A 的坐标映射到 B 的预测变换</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Phi_AB within the core bidirectional gradient inverse consistent registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"交换输入得到的反向预测变换\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Phi_BA within the core bidirectional gradient inverse consistent registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Phi_BA\" data-node-name-en=\"Phi_BA\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_068_gradicon', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Phi_BA</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">交换输入得到的反向预测变换</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Phi_BA within the core bidirectional gradient inverse consistent registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"计算 A∘Phi_AB、B∘Phi_BA 并评估图像匹配\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Bidirectional Warping within the core bidirectional gradient inverse consistent registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"双向 warping\" data-node-name-en=\"Bidirectional Warping\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_068_gradicon', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">双向 warping</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Bidirectional Warping</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">计算 A∘Phi_AB、B∘Phi_BA 并评估图像匹配</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Bidirectional Warping within the core bidirectional gradient inverse consistent registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"Phi_AB∘Phi_BA 与 Phi_BA∘Phi_AB 应接近 identity\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 06 within the core bidirectional gradient inverse consistent registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"映射复合\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 06\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_068_gradicon', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">映射复合</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 06</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">Phi_AB∘Phi_BA 与 Phi_BA∘Phi_AB 应接近 identity</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 06 within the core bidirectional gradient inverse consistent registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对复合映射求空间梯度/Jacobian，而非只比较位移值\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Composed Jacobian within the core bidirectional gradient inverse consistent registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"复合 Jacobian\" data-node-name-en=\"Composed Jacobian\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_068_gradicon', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">复合 Jacobian</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Composed Jacobian</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对复合映射求空间梯度/Jacobian，而非只比较位移值</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Composed Jacobian within the core bidirectional gradient inverse consistent registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"惩罚 ∇(Phi_AB∘Phi_BA)-I 及反向项，并结合图像相似度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies GradICON loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"GradICON 损失\" data-node-name-en=\"GradICON loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_068_gradicon', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">GradICON 损失</span><span class=\"lang-en\">GradICON loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">惩罚 ∇(Phi_AB∘Phi_BA)-I 及反向项，并结合图像相似度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies GradICON loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"近似 inverse-consistent 的配准场与 warped images\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces approximately diffeomorphic, inverse-consistent forward map φ^ab and backward map φ^ba via Bidirectional Deformation.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"双向形变\" data-node-name-en=\"Bidirectional Deformation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_068_gradicon', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">双向形变</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Bidirectional Deformation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">近似 inverse-consistent 的配准场与 warped images</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces approximately diffeomorphic, inverse-consistent forward map φ^ab and backward map φ^ba via Bidirectional Deformation.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"GradICON Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 复合映射梯度的双向逆一致性</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Gradient Inverse Consistency Regularizer: ||∇(Φ^AB ∘ Φ^BA)(x) − I||_F²</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"GradICON：核心公式 · 复合映射梯度的双向逆一致性\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"68\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"11.882335pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.000129 229.303248 11.882335\" width=\"229.303248pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.571948 0L4.564702-.115929C4.093741-.152157 4.028531-.210121 3.912602-.739047L3.072117-4.840034H2.847505L.58689-1.217254C-.028982-.253595-.101438-.173893-.434734-.115929L-.427488 0H1.115816L1.108571-.115929C.688328-.152157 .601381-.188385 .594136-.369524C.594136-.507189 .601381-.579645 .731802-.818748L1.202763-1.644742L2.956188-1.637496L3.151818-.688328C3.159064-.623118 3.166309-.557908 3.173555-.499944C3.180801-.224612 3.064872-.159402 2.535946-.115929L2.543191 0H4.571948ZM2.905469-1.898337H1.362165L2.521455-3.782182L2.905469-1.898337Z\" id=\"m068_g7-22\"></path><path d=\"M4.398055-1.449112C4.383563-1.978038 4.115478-2.246123 3.303975-2.543191C3.898111-2.666366 4.137214-2.753313 4.4053-2.956188C4.629912-3.130082 4.745841-3.369185 4.738596-3.666253C4.709614-4.354581 4.129969-4.73135 3.086608-4.73135H.999887V-4.615421C1.521567-4.579194 1.651988-4.528475 1.659233-4.318353C1.659233-4.20967 1.623005-4.035777 1.579532-3.854638L.579645-.6521C.449225-.231858 .384015-.188385-.079701-.115929L-.072456 0H2.260615C3.550324 0 4.427037-.58689 4.398055-1.449112ZM3.485114-1.463603C3.514096-.681083 2.934452-.217367 1.934564-.217367C1.594023-.217367 1.405639-.318805 1.405639-.52168C1.398393-.615873 1.48534-.941923 1.659233-1.521567L1.92731